Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.14,0:05:01.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我走到哪里都会看到那个男人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.11,0:05:03.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We take the same bus, we go to the same bookstore,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.11,0:05:03.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们搭同一班公车  去同一家书店
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.68,0:05:06.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and the same dry cleaners. Maybe he's the tea guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.68,0:05:06.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}同一家干洗店  或许他就是我的真命天子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.28,0:05:11.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Phoebe, did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.28,0:05:11.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比  你们看到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.36,0:05:14.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He totally checked you out! And he is so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.36,0:05:14.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他绝对是在打量你  而且他超帅的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.83,0:05:21.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mine is a picture of the Village People. What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.83,0:05:21.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的茶叶像是乡巴佬  那是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.04,0:05:54.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tea gives Phoebe the trots!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.04,0:05:54.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比喝茶会拉肚子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.52,0:06:05.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought Joey and I would be okay once we hung out,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.52,0:06:05.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为乔伊跟我待在一起就不会尴尬了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.37,0:06:08.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but it's like we don't even know how to be with each other any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.37,0:06:08.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但现在我们都不知道该怎么相处
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.14,0:06:10.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I konw, it's tough now, but things will get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.14,0:06:10.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽说你们现在很难相处  但情况会改善的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.47,0:06:12.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.47,0:06:12.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.16,0:06:14.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What if it gets worse and worse and worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.16,0:06:14.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果情况不断恶化...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.71,0:06:17.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}to the point where we can't be in the same room with each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.71,0:06:17.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们都无法共处一室了该怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.74,0:06:20.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not great at the advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.74,0:06:20.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不善于给人提建议
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.15,0:06:23.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can I interest you in a sarcastic comment?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.15,0:06:23.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我能讽刺你一番吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.59,0:06:26.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Some cheese?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.59,0:06:26.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要奶酪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.73,0:06:33.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Honey, why is the Bruce Springsteen CD
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.73,0:06:33.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老公  为什么布鲁斯·史普林斯汀的CD
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.11,0:06:35.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}in the Cat Stevens case?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.11,0:06:35.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}会放在凯特·史帝文斯的盒子里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.13,0:06:37.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's just say if I can't find the right CD case,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.13,0:06:37.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我找不到正确的盒子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.06,0:06:38.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just put it in the nearest one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.06,0:06:38.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就会随手拿个盒子来装
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.46,0:06:41.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Where is the Cat Stevens CD?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.46,0:06:41.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那凯特·史帝文斯的CD在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:43.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In the James Taylor case.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:43.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在詹姆士·泰勒的盒子里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.11,0:06:45.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Where is James Taylor CD?  Honey, I'll save you some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.11,0:06:45.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那张CD在哪里  我帮你节省些时间吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.00,0:06:48.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Two hundred CDs, not one of them in the right case.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.00,0:06:48.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那200张CD没有一张是放在正确盒子里的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.57,0:06:54.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. No need to panic. Deep breaths, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.57,0:06:54.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  不需要慌张  大家深呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.42,0:06:57.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, we're just gonna have to spend some time
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.42,0:06:57.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们只需要花些时间
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.38,0:06:59.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and put the CDs in the right cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.38,0:06:59.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把CD放在正确的盒子里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.06,0:07:01.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If we do that, we should come up with some kind of order.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.06,0:07:01.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果要整理的话  那就应该按某种顺序排好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.28,0:07:03.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, alphabetically or by genre?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.28,0:07:03.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}按字母顺序或音乐风格
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.67,0:07:06.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. We have to talk this through.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.67,0:07:06.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道  这件事我们得好好商量
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.20,0:07:09.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God, you guys have such problems!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.20,0:07:09.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  你们有什么毛病啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.31,0:07:11.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I feel so terrible for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.31,0:07:11.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真为你们感到难过
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.96,0:07:15.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. Okay, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.96,0:07:15.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.47,0:07:17.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, you and Joey, you're both focusing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.47,0:07:17.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你和乔伊两个人满脑子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.22,0:07:18.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}on this uncomfortable thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.22,0:07:18.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}都是这件烦人的事
