Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.93,0:07:25.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  那挺有道理的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.41,0:07:27.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. I don't know, maybe you have a work problem
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.41,0:07:27.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许你在工作上有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.76,0:07:29.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}that you need his advice on.
