Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.45,0:07:35.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Honey, the Miami Vice soundtrack? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.45,0:07:35.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你连迈阿密天龙的原声带都有吗
