Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.28,0:08:18.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你工作上出了大问题
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.61,0:08:21.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. It's, uh...
