Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.12,0:09:02.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么  我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.51,0:09:05.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know, I told you, it's a really big problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.51,0:09:05.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟你说过了  这真的是个大问题
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.59,0:09:10.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} He wants to buy your baby?  Can you believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.59,0:09:10.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他要买你的宝宝  你能相信吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.11,0:09:12.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} That's crazy.  That's what I told him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.11,0:09:12.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那太疯狂了  我就是那么跟他说的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.39,0:09:15.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} How did this even happen?  Well, I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.39,0:09:15.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么会发生这种事  我会告诉你的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.66,0:09:25.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, my boss and his wife, they can't have children, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.66,0:09:25.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我老板跟他太太  他们不孕  所以...
