Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.44,0:09:32.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Rachel, I want to buy your baby."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.44,0:09:32.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"瑞秋  我要买下你的宝宝"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.53,0:09:34.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.53,0:09:34.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.46,0:09:38.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When you said it was a problem about your boss and the baby...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.46,0:09:38.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说问题出在老板跟宝宝身上的时候...
