Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.26,0:09:41.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为你是指产假的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.13,0:09:43.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.13,0:09:43.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.85,0:09:56.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, that would have been a much simpler problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.85,0:09:56.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  那样子问题就简单多了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.31,0:10:09.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Oh, hello.  Oh, it's you. I see you everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.31,0:10:09.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好  是你  我走到哪里都会碰到你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.10,0:10:10.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm Jim. Jim Nelson.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.10,0:10:10.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是吉米  吉米·尼尔森
